<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Meyra | İndir</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #081224;
      --bg2: #0d1d36;
      --card: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --muted: #cbd5e1;
      --gold: #f4c542;
      --gold-2: #ffdf75;
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      --shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Display", "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(244,197,66,0.18), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg2) 0%, var(--bg) 100%);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .wrap {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .card {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08), rgba(255,255,255,0.05));
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border-radius: 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 32px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .glow {
      position: absolute;
      inset: auto -80px -80px auto;
      width: 220px;
      height: 220px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(244,197,66,0.22), transparent 65%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 112px;
      height: 112px;
      border-radius: 28px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .subtitle {
      margin: 14px auto 0;
      max-width: 560px;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(244,197,66,0.25);
      background: rgba(244,197,66,0.08);
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .buttons {
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    .store-btn {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      transition: transform 0.18s ease, background 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease;
    }

    .store-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.11);
      border-color: rgba(244,197,66,0.38);
    }

    .icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 24px;
      background: rgba(244,197,66,0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(244,197,66,0.2);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .store-text {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      text-align: left;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .store-text small {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .store-text strong {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 22px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .footer a {
      color: var(--gold-2);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .card { padding: 26px 18px; }
      .store-btn { justify-content: flex-start; }
      .store-text strong { font-size: 18px; }
      .subtitle { font-size: 16px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="glow"></div>

      <!-- İstersen bunu GitHub Pages'e yüklemeden önce kendi logo URL'in ile değiştir -->
      <img
        class="logo"
        src="https://omerozkan1.github.io/meyra/icon.png"
        alt="Meyra logo"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'"
      />

      <h1>Meyra'yı indir</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Namaz vakitleri, zikir takibi, Kur'an ve daha fazlası. Manevi yolculuğuna şimdi başla.
      </p>

      <div class="badge">✨ iPhone ve Android için hazır</div>

      <div class="buttons">
        <a class="store-btn" href="https://apps.apple.com/tr/app/meyra-namaz-vakitleri/id6759878169?l=tr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="icon"></span>
          <span class="store-text">
            <small>Hemen indir</small>
            <strong>App Store</strong>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a class="store-btn" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.omerozkan.meyra" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="icon">🤖</span>
          <span class="store-text">
            <small>Hemen indir</small>
            <strong>Google Play</strong>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        Linkleri kendi App Store ve Google Play adreslerinle değiştirip bu dosyayı
        <strong>index.html</strong> olarak GitHub Pages'e yükleyebilirsin.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
